# career-dashboard-ui — generated build inputs & toolchain. The tracked sources
# are main.go, open_*.go, go.mod/go.sum, winres/winres.json, winres/icon.ico,
# gen-icon.py and build-dashboard-ui.mjs; everything below is (re)produced by
# build-dashboard-ui.mjs or gen-icon.py and must never be committed.
#
# NOTE: icon.ico IS tracked — winres/winres.json references it, so a fresh clone
# can run `go-winres make` without regenerating it first.
app/
node.exe
.gobin/
*.syso
icon-*.png
# Stray exe built in-place (the canonical output lives at the repo root as
# career-dashboard-ui.exe, gitignored there). Ignore here so a stray local
# build in this dir never gets staged by accident.
dashboard-ui.exe
